# Store and check out text as UTF-8 + LF on every OS. core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows plus an editor re-save once turned tuner/index.html into CRLF
# Latin-1 / GBK mojibake; pinning eol keeps diffs honest.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pbf binary
*.woff2 binary
